#include <iostream>
#include <cmath>
int main() {
  double x = M_PI/4;
  double cos_x = cos(x);
  double sin_x = sin(x);
  return 0;
}
```
Overall, Euler's Formula is a powerful and versatile mathematical tool that has applications in many fields. Its ability to relate exponential, trigonometric, and complex functions makes it a valuable tool for solving complex problems.

